# Reference screenshots pasted into chat land here under whatever name the attachment step gives
# them (image.png, image2.png, a typo'd iamge.png, ...) — never a name worth guessing in advance.
# The only real tracked PNG (assets/icon.png) lives in a subdirectory, so this is root-only.
/*.png
/@eaDir/
